== Undocumented changes ==
=== Additions ===
* Added a screen shaking visual effect when [[Curse of the Maze]] is active.
* Added an awakening animation to [[Homunculus]] and [[Begotten]].
* [[I AM ERROR]] rooms on {{s|Chest}} and {{s|Dark Room}} now generate brand new floors.

=== Changes ===
* Removed the version number from the main menu.
* Curse of the Maze now shuffles room layouts more randomly.
* When the player has {{i|Proptosis}} and {{i|Anti-Gravity}}, tears will not begin shrinking until they start moving.
* Modified the enemy [[creep]] animation.
* Modified the teleport animation.
* Removed the [[Lemon Party]] pill's white flash.
* Shortened the window to steal a [[Boss Rush]] item with a teleport and have the other items remain.
* Improved the damage on the beams from {{i|Crack the Sky}}.

=== Fixes ===
* [[Pin]] and [[Scolex]]'s health bars now accurately depletes.
* [[Library|Libraries]] now correctly play their music track.
* Fixed the bug where the player could play as [[Eden]] even without having any Eden tokens available.

== New bugs ==
* {{i|Ipecac}} shots no longer affect [[machine]]s and [[beggar]]s.
* {{i|Pyromaniac}} no longer provides invincibility from {{i|Ipecac}} shots.

